      "writtenOn": "2025-08-22T19:35:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we need to do something and merge it back to 140. Doesn\u0027t necessarily have to be a revert, but it\u0027s easiest to revert first so we have a chance to actually consider the limits changes when relanding.\n\nThe limits that changed are\n- `maxDynamic{Storage,Uniform}BuffersPerPipelineLayout` - these changed directly\n- `maxStorageTextures{InFragmentStage,InVertexStage,PerShaderStage}` - I think these changed due to tiering changes on `maxDynamic*`\n\nI don\u0027t think it\u0027s unsolvable.\n- We could have an extra limit for `immediates + dynamic offsets`. (I don\u0027t think this is the only backend where they\u0027re effectively the same thing.)\n- We could change the definition of `maxImmediateSize` so it includes dynamic offsets too (same reason).\n- We could move either or both into a uniform buffer so they take fixed space.\n\nBut we can\u0027t do that in 2 days (for 140 Stable).",
      "parentUuid": "8ce06556_3dc8ea8a",
      "revId": "2dbc18a487756221dccd1e33bf81facda39dd415",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
