      "writtenOn": "2025-08-25T01:37:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eShaobo, did you have ideas on how to optimize the root signature more? (for later)\n\nRaised an issue about this https://issues.chromium.org/issues/428802462 before. And some potential ways to do:\n1. Storage Buffer Sizes might not used always, we could set them on demand.\n2. Compress sizes things into uint16_t to reserve some space.\n3, Investigating DBO supporting, it occupies lots of spaces.",
      "parentUuid": "c43245f7_87e6905c",
      "revId": "2dbc18a487756221dccd1e33bf81facda39dd415",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
